0001B996                            ; ZONE ANIMATION PROCEDURES AND SCRIPTS
0001B996                            ;
0001B996                            ; Each zone gets two entries in this jump table. The first entry points to the
0001B996                            ; zone's animation procedure (usually Dynamic_Null, AKA none). The second points
0001B996                            ; to the zone's animation script.
0001B996                            ;
0001B996                            ; Seems like stage IDs were already being shifted, since listings for $07-$0F
0001B996                            ; can be found, alongside HPZ's art listed from $08 (its ID in the final).
0001B996                            ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
