0007A456                            
0007A456                            ; ===========================================================================
0007A456                            ; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
0007A456                            ; PSG Note Values: c-1 to a-6
0007A456                            ;
0007A456                            ; Each row is an octave, starting with C and ending with B. Sonic 3's driver
0007A456                            ; adds another octave at the start, as well as two more notes and the end to
0007A456                            ; complete the last octave. Notably, a-6 is changed from 0 to $10. These
0007A456                            ; changes need to be applied here in order for ports of songs from Sonic 3
0007A456                            ; and later to sound correct.
0007A456                            ;
0007A456                            ; Here is what Sonic 3's version of this table looks like:
0007A456                            ;	dc.w $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3FF, $3F7, $3BE, $388
0007A456                            ;	dc.w $356, $326, $2F9, $2CE, $2A5, $280, $25C, $23A, $21A, $1FB, $1DF, $1C4
0007A456                            ;	dc.w $1AB, $193, $17D, $167, $153, $140, $12E, $11D, $10D,  $FE,  $EF,  $E2
0007A456                            ;	dc.w  $D6,  $C9,  $BE,  $B4,  $A9,  $A0,  $97,  $8F,  $87,  $7F,  $78,  $71
